; Curriculum deployment runtime types.
;
; The request root is a data enum whose variants are the main operations.
; No CurriculumRequest wrapper:
; Generate.{ «/curriculum» [ Psyche.«/psyche» Mind.«/mind» Field.«/field» ] «/primary» «/run/user/1001/curriculum/curriculum.sock» }
; is the whole request. Curriculum gives the role data; each skill source is an
; aspect repository whose modules sit at <kind>/<subject>/<version>.md. The
; last string is the Curriculum Nexus's socket: every role packet is the
; Nexus's ComposeRole answer for that role, and the skill sources serve the
; skills alone.
;
; What a role projection asks the Curriculum Nexus, and what it answers, is
; the Nexus's own wire, signal-curriculum-nexus. The roles file is
; Curriculum's own format, RolesDocument, which this crate takes from the
; curriculum crate and keeps no copy of.

Library
[ :signal_curriculum_nexus:[ RoleSelection Surface ] ]
[ SkillSource.[ Psyche.String Mind.String Field.String ]
  Configuration.{ String Vector<SkillSource> String String }
  RoleProjection.{ RoleSelection String }
  RoleProjectionConfiguration.{ String String Vector<RoleProjection> }
  Request.[ Generate.Configuration Check.Configuration Visualize.Configuration
            ProjectRoles.RoleProjectionConfiguration ]
  Output.[ Generated.{ Integer Integer }
           Checked.{ Integer Integer }
           Visualized.{ Integer Integer }
           RolesProjected.{ Integer } ]
  GeneratedRoleOutputs.{ Vector<String> }
  GeneratedRoleOutputDocument.[ GeneratedRoleOutputs ]
  RoleSourceProvenance.{ String String String String String String String }
  RoleOutputProvenance.{ String String Surface String String String Vector<RoleSourceProvenance> }
  GeneratedRoleProvenance.{ Vector<RoleOutputProvenance> }
  GeneratedRoleProvenanceDocument.[ GeneratedRoleProvenance ] ]

[]
[]
